§§ `83.05(8) to (11) a new application, the five-year review, validity, publication, "judge"`

-- (8) a bar: "may not make another application ... except if ..."; once an exception is met the bar is lifted (fork F-ccc3-5).
-- COVERS: fork F-ccc3-5 | s 83.05(8) the listed entity is barred from making another application | s 83.05(8)*
-- src:1476 | New application
-- src:1477 | (8) A listed entity may not make another application under subsection (2) except if, since the time when the entity made its last application,
-- src:1478 | (a) there has been a material change in its circumstances; or
-- src:1479 | (b) the Minister has completed a review under subsection (8.1) with respect to that entity.
@ref s 83.05(8) (src:1476-1479)
GIVEN `the entity has made a previous application under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `since the time when it made its last application there has been a material change in its circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
      `since then the Minister has completed a review under subsection (8.1) with respect to that entity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 83.05(8) the listed entity is barred from making another application` MEANS
    IF NOT `the entity has made a previous application under subsection (2)`
    THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "may not make another application under subsection (2)"
    ELSE IF `since the time when it made its last application there has been a material change in its circumstances` OR `since then the Minister has completed a review under subsection (8.1) with respect to that entity`
         THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "except if, since the time when the entity made its last application"
         ELSE JUST TRUE

-- (8.1) the Minister's review: "within five years after (i) the day on which this subsection comes into force, if the entity is a listed entity on that day, or (ii) the day on which the entity is added to the list,
-- if added after that day; and (b) subsequently, within five years after the most recent recommendation made under this subsection with respect to the entity".
-- The day on which this subsection comes into force is not in the text: it is an input.
-- COVERS: encoded | s 83.05(8.1) the last day for the Minister's review | s 83.05(8.1)*
-- src:1480 | Review — listed entity
-- src:1481 | (8.1) The Minister shall review whether there are still reasonable grounds, as set out in subsection (1), for an entity to be a listed entity and make a recommendation to the Governor in Council as to whether the entity should remain a listed entity
-- src:1482 | (a) within five years after
-- src:1483 | (i) the day on which this subsection comes into force, if the entity is a listed entity on that day, or
-- src:1484 | (ii) the day on which the entity is added to the list, if the entity is added to the list after the day on which this subsection comes into force; and
-- src:1485 | (b) subsequently, within five years after the most recent recommendation made under this subsection with respect to the entity.
@ref s 83.05(8.1) (src:1480-1485)
GIVEN `the day on which this subsection comes into force` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the entity was added to the list` IS A DATE
      `the day of the most recent recommendation made under this subsection, if there is one` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 83.05(8.1) the last day for the Minister's review` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the day of the most recent recommendation made under this subsection, if there is one`
    WHEN JUST recommended THEN `add years` recommended 5
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF `the day on which the entity was added to the list` AT MOST `the day on which this subsection comes into force`
        THEN `add years` `the day on which this subsection comes into force` 5
        ELSE `add years` `the day on which the entity was added to the list` 5

-- COVERS: encoded | s 83.05(9) reviews under subsection (8.1) do not affect the validity of the list | s 83.05(9)
-- src:1486 | Validity
-- src:1487 | (9) Reviews undertaken under subsection (8.1) do not affect the validity of the list.
@ref s 83.05(9) (src:1486-1487)
GIVEN `the review was undertaken under subsection (8.1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 83.05(9) reviews under subsection (8.1) do not affect the validity of the list` MEANS
    IF `the review was undertaken under subsection (8.1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Reviews undertaken under subsection (8.1) do not affect the validity of the list"

-- (10) "within five years after the review is completed".
-- COVERS: encoded | s 83.05(10) the notice of the results of the review is published in time | s 83.05(10)
-- src:1488 | Publication
-- src:1489 | (10) The Minister shall cause notice of the results of every review of a listed entity undertaken under subsection (8.1) to be published in the Canada Gazette within five years after the review is completed.
@ref s 83.05(10) (src:1488-1489)
GIVEN `the day on which the review was completed` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the notice was published in the Canada Gazette` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 83.05(10) the notice of the results of the review is published in time` MEANS
    IF `the day on which the notice was published in the Canada Gazette` AT MOST (`add years` `the day on which the review was completed` 5)
    THEN JUST TRUE
